<%# The address was found, but nothing accepted the connection. %>
<p>
  Roe found the server's address, but nothing there accepted the connection.
  The server may be off, still starting up, or blocking SSH at its firewall.
</p>

<ol>
  <li>Check the server is running in your host's dashboard.</li>
  <li>Check that port 22 (SSH) is open to your address.</li>
  <li>Try connecting by hand. The same error means it isn't Roe:</li>
</ol>
<pre>ssh <%= user %>@<%= host %></pre>

<p>Then deploy again.</p>

<p>
  More detail:
  <a href="/documentation/roe/troubleshoot-deployment#troubleshooting-kamal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Troubleshooting → Deployment</a>
</p>
